2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2410) 'What the rc holds
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2410  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2410) '&{repo("interactor-fabric-zone")} and &{repo("interactor-voice")} placed. `ca.elf` and the capability table. The transport over the host's UDP. The zone with the one-owner search. The worker zone and `asset.elf` with the corrupted chunk. Voice with the dropped packet. The zone journals on &{repo("service-bao-sqlite-fdb")} over FoundationDB, read back by `bao read` and resumed after a restart. `weftspun-zone` deployed and the two-client gate run against its address with the headset as one client and the desktop as the other and the sidecar.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2410  1 LINE
 Text:Written

